{"resourceIdentifier":"4376","resourceName":"Haishang Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"Haishang Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) locates in Lejia Village, Tangtianshi Town, Shaoyang County, Shaoyang City, Hunan Province, P.R China. The project is owned and implemented by Shaoyang County Haishang Ecological Agriculture Technology Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as the project owner).\r\n\r\nThe project is to collect methane from swine manure treatment at Xiangcun Swine Farm in Tangtianshi Town, Shaoyang County, Shaoyang City, Hunan Province. The swine farm is designed to produce 150,000 swine annually. The project treats the raw manure from the swine farm by anaerobic digester, and uses the biogas generated during the treatment process for power generation.","location":{"latitude":26.876944,"longitude":111.191388},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-05-10","endExclusive":"2023-06-10","endInclusive":"2023-06-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4376"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shaoyang City, Hunan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shaoyang County Haishang Ecological Agriculture Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"58300"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"19/11/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT